{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a36a966a484b23c4de9ccd088e3865091be057cde2f1a65f5640f102cb990489", "ja": "（今日は千鶴さんと遊園地に来ている。途中で迷子の\n子どもを見つけ、迷子センターに送り届けた……）", "zh": "（今天和千鹤小姐一起来到了游乐园。途中发现了一个迷路的孩子，把她送到了寻人中心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1001_kodomo", "source_sha256": "bdda62d6633f2b5405bf9cd413a6a2779dcbc3f1b1349ad8ae6aecdcf9c71ebc", "ja": "お姉ちゃんたち、ありがとー！\nバイバーイ！", "zh": "姐姐们，谢谢——！\n拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "a236a2b4e4f7f6663cf3a6760b32959d2029c27a0608148a24b8883b8f7bcc39", "ja": "ええ、ごきげんよう！\n楽しい時間を過ごしてくださいね♪", "zh": "嗯，祝你们过得愉快！\n请好好享受这段快乐时光哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0c0bb032102154352732bb2ec07c638f6aff0025496ed101cef202c75749175e", "ja": "お疲れ様でした、千鶴さん。\n思わぬハプニングでしたね。", "zh": "辛苦了，千鹤。\n真是场意想不到的突发状况呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "7ecbe03da756bf3573840b08634cdb0a9404a7850b6d68a2e559c0b1c4a7cdba", "ja": "ええ。無事にご両親と再会できてなによりですわ。\n{$P$}も、ご苦労様でした。", "zh": "是的。能平安和父母重逢，真是太好了。\n{$P$}先生也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1a70f2649130dde4b777d566500eb004d415c59d362a768654b1c47028efd92e", "ja": "いえ。ほとんど任せきりで……。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "不，基本都交给你负责了……\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "84f6589e71e60f85fa5096842bc6c86afca2f9351e7d3e184c0908ce0a5d8075", "ja": "子ども相手ですから、仕方ありませんわ。\nですが……ふふっ。", "zh": "面对小孩子，这也是没办法的事。\n不过……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "131aaefcf74d527342f32a47e91a19941d889e455212edf1478e029142211b9c", "ja": "{$P$}が、あんなに慌てるなんて。\n初めて見たかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "{$P$}居然会那么慌张。\n我可能还是第一次见到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7ba7e9cd776eea0d8766a1135da794178ff339fb02c06e2b767d2307f3900504", "ja": "あははっ……。しかし、千鶴さんがいてくれて\n助かりました。本当のお母さんみたいでした。", "zh": "啊哈哈……不过，幸好有千鹤小姐在。简直就像真正的妈妈一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "0348cea0adaafcaf8dfea94d495a42982d349b7a030770107f943bd83a43d14f", "ja": "えっ！　おか……！？", "zh": "诶！妈妈……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6f8d98d624dd3e2719734c7d7c001db77a8b1e1422f81408268430bef2d53e4c", "ja": "はい。絶大な安心感があるというか……。", "zh": "是的。该说是有着无比强烈的安心感……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "fc7bddfe906063bd769a489952b1c230150875985a0aa99c23e22fdd5fccef17", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\nそういう意味での『お母さん』ということですのね。", "zh": "原、原来如此……  \n也就是说，是这个意义上的“妈妈”呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "1df949eb29c24c0eed2b800f743694998237489fc9658814688838f34d2a6070", "ja": "そういえば、先程の子どもも……。\n最初は、わたくしを母親と勘違いしてましたわ。", "zh": "说起来，刚才那个孩子也是……\n一开始还把我误认为母亲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "bb9db9d4a91299b6bcaf63da29ee155a43c4a1ad76ec8167594a09156c27effd", "ja": "ハッ！　もしかして、わたくし……思っているよりも\n年上に見られているのでしょうか？", "zh": "哈！难道说，我……看起来比自己想象的还要年长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6cc3486c0d441aa8f604311b345d9dda6931b9b64ac5a49a4432665b73a5f8f7", "ja": "千鶴さんは、同世代の人より落ち着いてますから、\n年上に見られることも多いかもしれませんね。", "zh": "千鹤小姐比同龄人沉稳，所以可能经常会被看起来比实际年龄大吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "de93bde4747d0722fb6003db6f71a5ec7ea8215d9f72e4495feaf6bf518b5ba6", "ja": "でもその雰囲気のおかげで、迷子に気づけましたし、\nあの子も安心して、千鶴さんを頼ったんだと思います。", "zh": "不过也正因为您给人的感觉沉稳，才能注意到那名迷路的孩子吧。那孩子也安心下来，觉得可以依靠您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "89d82c55d938ca57eb56891f18d1bc27641de1023d4623bd0c5ad1467c44c139", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。わたくしは、てっきり\nこの服装にも原因があるのではと思ったのですが……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……我还以为，这身打扮也是原因之一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "59f16de8f8ea86cae0ff72d77fd899e98cdf333d4f2187ad649ea6fc30702e2c", "ja": "そんなことないですよ。\n大人っぽくて、とても素敵です。", "zh": "没那回事。显得成熟又漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "70be7592e43e7936edc6094ec1b897417cca12d4e6fdded18e32b6e2fcd09733", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}ったら……！\nしかし、あの子が勘違いしたということは……。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}真是的……！\n不过，既然那孩子误会了，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "6ccc78d75fb180afadbbaa00e375aef5f3e0b947b6e1a55f27328db7b60b4900", "ja": "え？　それはつまり、わたくしたちが、\nふ、夫婦に見えたと……？", "zh": "诶？也就是说，我们看起来像、像夫妻……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0cba41a826ba9e1c46b99dd14f448724991b926dfb71f79163e63301ebaf057e", "ja": "……千鶴さん？", "zh": "……千鹤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "51294b02e3197e79ca3aeedcd3126f53782229d8ebccad4241fbe65658b02312", "ja": "な、なんでもありませんわ……！\nそれより、そろそろパレードに向けて準備をしないと。", "zh": "没、没什么……！\n比起这个，差不多该为游行做准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "4440cd572dd4cc3f38a292934cf5823f10f9e0bf304483186b3f403a146934db", "ja": "眺めのいいポイントはチェック済みですわ。\nさあ、参りましょう、{$P$}！", "zh": "视野开阔的地点我已经确认过了。\n来吧，我们走，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0414_1023_p", "source_sha256": "eb2f65202ea5a893b3484f805ee3112332ca8beaa87957fe1997d4febe54c5b2", "ja": "（そういって、千鶴さんは足早に歩いていった。\n心なしか顔が赤い気がしたけど……夕日のせいかな？）", "zh": "（说完这些，千鹤小姐便快步走远了。\n总觉得她的脸好像有点红……是夕阳的缘故吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
